                <pb facs="0490" n="406" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg406"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to Mr. Porter.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-04-24"><hi rendition="#italic">April 24,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Loomis states that the United States European Squadron has been directed to
                    proceed to Marseille to participate in the reception of the President of France
                    on April 30.)</p>
            </div>
